{"resourceType":"ValueSet","id":"designation-use","meta":{"lastUpdated":"2026-07-17T17:22:54.721+10:00"},"text":{"status":"extensions","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet designation-use</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"designation-use\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcdesignation-use\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/900000000000003001\">900000000000003001</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Fully specified name</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/900000000000013009\">900000000000013009</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Synonym</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-hl7TermMaintInfra.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/hl7TermMaintInfra</code>\n                </a>\n